<h1 class="page-title">Academic Calendar</h1>





<div id="textcontainer" class="page_content">
<h2>2026-2027</h2>
<p>University Registrar calendars can be obtained on the <a href="http://registrar.unc.edu" target="_blank">University Registrar's website</a>. For more information on Summer and Maymester Sessions, visit the <a href="http://summer.unc.edu" target="_blank">Summer School's website</a>.</p>
<p><span data-teams="true">*Professional School Students – please check with the Dean of your school as the dates of Wellbeing Days may vary.</span></p>
<h3>Summer Session I (SSI) and Maymester (MM) 2026</h3>
<table class="sc_sctable tbl_academiccalendar">
<caption class="hidden noscript">Academic Calendar</caption>
<colgroup><col class="column0"/><col class="column1"/></colgroup>
<thead>
<tr class="sctablehead hidden noscript">
<th scope="col" class="column0">Event</th>
<th scope="col" class="column1">Date</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="even firstrow"><td class="column0"><strong>MM and SSI classes begin</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Wednesday, May 13</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>MM last day for late registration</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Wednesday, May 13</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>SSI last day for late registration</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Thursday, May 14</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Holiday (Memorial Day). No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, May 25</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>MM classes end/exams</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Thursday, May 28<br/>Friday, May 29</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>SSI classes end</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Tuesday, June 16</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>SSI reading day</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Wednesday, June 17</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Holiday (Juneteenth). No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Friday, June 19</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even last lastrow"><td class="column0"><strong>SSI exam days</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Thursday, June 18<br/>Saturday, June 20</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h3>Summer Session II (SSII) 2026</h3>
<table class="sc_sctable tbl_academiccalendar">
<caption class="hidden noscript">Academic Calendar</caption>
<colgroup><col class="column0"/><col class="column1"/></colgroup>
<thead>
<tr class="sctablehead hidden noscript">
<th scope="col" class="column0">Event</th>
<th scope="col" class="column1">Date</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="even firstrow"><td class="column0"><strong>SSII classes begin</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, June 22</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>SSII last day for late registration</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Tuesday, June 23</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Holiday (Independence Day). No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Friday, July 3</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>SSII classes end</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Thursday, July 23</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>SSII reading day</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Friday, July 24</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd last lastrow"><td class="column0"><strong>SSII exam days</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, July 27<br/>Tuesday, July 28</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h3>Fall Semester 2026</h3>
<table class="sc_sctable tbl_academiccalendar">
<caption class="hidden noscript">Academic Calendar</caption>
<colgroup><col class="column0"/><col class="column1"/></colgroup>
<thead>
<tr class="sctablehead hidden noscript">
<th scope="col" class="column0">Event</th>
<th scope="col" class="column1">Date</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="even firstrow"><td class="column0"><strong>New student convocation</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Sunday, August 16</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Classes begin</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, August 17</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Last day for late registration</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Friday, August 21</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Holiday (Labor Day). No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, September 7</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Well-being days. No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, September 21<br/>Tuesday, October 6</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>University Day. Classes held</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, October 12th</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Fall break.  No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Thursday, October 15<br/>Friday, October 16</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Thanksgiving recess. No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Wednesday, November 25<br/>Thursday, November 26<br/>Friday, November 27</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Classes end</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Wednesday, December 2</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Reading days</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Thursday, December 3<br/>Wednesday, December 9<br/></td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Exam days</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Friday, December 4<br/>Saturday, December 5<br/>Monday, December 7<br/>Tuesday, December 8<br/>Thursday, December 10<br/>Friday, December 11</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd last lastrow"><td class="column0"><strong>Fall Commencement</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Sunday, December 13</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h3>Spring Semester 2027</h3>
<table class="sc_sctable tbl_academiccalendar">
<caption class="hidden noscript">Academic Calendar</caption>
<colgroup><col class="column0"/><col class="column1"/></colgroup>
<thead>
<tr class="sctablehead hidden noscript">
<th scope="col" class="column0">Event</th>
<th scope="col" class="column1">Date</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="even firstrow"><td class="column0"><strong>Classes begin</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Wednesday, January 6</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Last day of late registration</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Tuesday, January 12</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Holiday (MLK Jr.). No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, January 18</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Well-being days</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, February 8<br/>Thursday, March 25</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Spring break begins 5:00 p.m.</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Friday, March 5</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Classes resume 8:00 a.m.</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, March 15</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Spring holiday. No classes</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Friday, March 26</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Classes end</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Monday, April 26</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even"><td class="column0"><strong>Reading days</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Tuesday, April 27<br/>Friday, April 30<br/>Wednesday, May 5</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd"><td class="column0"><strong>Exam days</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Wednesday, April 28<br/>Thursday, April 29<br/>Saturday, May 1<br/>Monday, May 3<br/>Tuesday, May 4<br/>Thursday, May 6</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even last lastrow"><td class="column0"><strong>Spring Commencement</strong></td>
<td class="column1">Saturday, May 8</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h3>Summer Session I (SSI) and Maymester (MM) 2027</h3>
<table class="sc_sctable tbl_academiccalendar">
